{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c47f","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a06f12-fa6f-76e2-8836-346b2c16c0e2"},"sequence":154,"recorded_at":1780531400000303,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"442e1aa4-e9ef-4d3f-b619-88e6c26afaec","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"442e1aa4-e9ef-4d3f-b619-88e6c26afaec","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"442e1aa4-e9ef-4d3f-b619-88e6c26afaec"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"f071b772-818b-423c-bc1c-f4be0740fcb5"},"task_id":"f071b772-818b-423c-bc1c-f4be0740fcb5","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"f071b772-818b-423c-bc1c-f4be0740fcb5","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.task-board/EPIC-260830-37rgqn_m0-contract-foundation/STORY-260830-3jqsx1_provider-plugin-host-and-protocol/TASK-260830-qcosxq_implement-provider-jsonl-protocol/README.md`.\n1|# TASK-260830-qcosxq: implement-provider-jsonl-protocol\n2|\n3|## Description\n4|Implement one-frame JSONL transport, deadlines, limits, stdout/stderr separation, operation dispatch, and status recovery. This is an implementation deliverable, not a specification rewrite.\n5|\n6|## Scope\n7|relux-works/agent-session-manager-spec@v0.5.0 (commit 28bf96d7dd7ebf3cd9e2ccd91d35b8660699dd5c); §7.1-7.7, §8. Work only inside the provider-plugin-host-and-protocol story boundary.\n8|\n9|## Acceptance Criteria\n10|Production behavior demonstrates: Implement one-frame JSONL transport, deadlines, limits, stdout/stderr separation, operation dispatch, and status recovery. Exact contract fixtures and negative/refusal cases pass; crash/idempotency evidence is included when the operation mutates durable state; no unsupported capability is advertised."}}}
